!
! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,
! using a COSCI wavefunction.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Fluorine atom.
.WAVE F
**GENERAL
.PCMOUT
**INTEGRALS
*TWOINT
.SOFOCK
.SCREEN
1.0D-12
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RESOLVE
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
4 0
.OPEN S
1
5/0,6
.INTFLG
1 1 0
.MAXITR
25
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8
.CNVINT
0.01 0.0001
*RESOLVE
.SCREEN
1.0D-20
!1.0D-12
.INTFLG
1 1 0
*END OF
 $GOSCIP IPRNT=5 &END
